{"dossier":"D01","entry_points":[{"sids":["kernel/sched/core.c::sched_init_smp","kernel/sched/topology.c::sched_init_domains"],"text":"SMP boot sets NUMA, domains under lock, placement, granularity, classes and servers before marking ready."}],"exports":[{"sids":["kernel/sched/core.c::state_filter_match","kernel/sched/core.c::show_state_filter","kernel/sched/debug.c::sysrq_sched_debug_show","kernel/sched/debug.c::sched_debug_header","kernel/sched/debug.c::print_cpu"],"text":"Filtered dump emits state matches; empty matches all with idle exclusion plus full debug and lock report. Versioned header and per-CPU counts, clocks and current with watchdog refresh under read protection."},{"sids":["kernel/sched/debug.c::proc_sched_show_task","kernel/sched/debug.c::sched_show_numa","kernel/sched/debug.c::print_numa_stats","kernel/sched/fair.c::print_cfs_stats","kernel/sched/rt.c::print_rt_stats","kernel/sched/deadline.c::print_dl_stats","kernel/sched/debug.c::print_cfs_rq","kernel/sched/debug.c::print_rt_rq","kernel/sched/debug.c::print_dl_rq"],"text":"Per-task identity, times, counters, utilization, clamps, sentinel averages, gated stats and NUMA. Fair, RT and deadline queues delegate with load, snapshotting trees under rq lock with read protection."},{"sids":["kernel/sched/core.c::init_idle","kernel/sched/cputime.c::vtime_init_idle","kernel/sched/core.c::cpuset_cpumask_can_shrink","kernel/sched/deadline.c::dl_cpuset_cpumask_can_shrink","kernel/sched/core.c::task_can_attach","kernel/sched/core.c::migrate_task_to"],"text":"Idle binds per-CPU thread with running, queued, thread and no-affinity markers, rq link, class, tracing, vtime and naming under nested masked locks. Shrink checks bandwidth; attach veto; migrate shortcuts same CPU."},{"sids":["kernel/sched/core.c::sched_cpu_deactivate","kernel/sched/core.c::sched_cpu_dying","kernel/sched/core.c::sched_cpu_starting","kernel/sched/core.c::sched_cpu_wait_empty","kernel/sched/core.c::sched_rq_cpu_starting"],"text":"Hotplug deac